he concentration of the compounds in the water phase was measured spectrophotometrically and Po/w value was calculated according to the equation: Po/w = (coctanol_before - cwater) / cwater where: coctanol_before = initial concentration of the ruthenium complex in octanol cwater = final concentration of the ruthenium complex in the water phase The experiment was conducted in triplicates."},{"abbreviation_in_the_article":"D2B","value":0.1,"value_relation":"=","type_authors":"logP","method":"shake-flask","aqueous_phase":"water","doi":"10.1002/cmdc.202300347","year":2023,"counterion":"[Cl-].[Cl-]","record_id":"MLDB-003880","detection":"UV-Vis","method_description":"Partition coefficients (LogP) for each complex were determined using the shake-flask method. A complex was dissolved in equal parts octanol and water or PBS, shaken for 30 min, and left to equilibrate for 24 h during which the aqueous and octanol phases separated. The distribution between phases was determined by measuring the absorbance at 460 nm in each phase. LogP values were calculated as the decadic logarithm of the ratio of solute concentrations in both phases."},{"abbreviation_in_the_article":"D2B","value":0.9,"value_relation":"=","type_authors":"logP","method":"shake-flask","aqueous_phase":"PBS","doi":"10.1002/cmdc.202300347","year":2023,"counterion":"[Cl-].[Cl-]","record_id":"MLDB-003885","detection":"UV-Vis","method_description":"Partition coefficients (LogP) for each complex were determined using the shake-flask method. A complex was dissolved in equal parts octanol and water or PBS, shaken for 30 min, and left to equilibrate for 24 h during which the aqueous and octanol phases separated. The distribution between phases was determined by measuring the absorbance at 460 nm in each phase. LogP values were calculated as the decadic logarithm of the ratio of solute concentrations in both phases."}]}